---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'September 3, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Grayz'n Buffalo"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill website."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-content">
      <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <p>
            Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy
            explains what information this website collects, how it is used, and
            the choices available to you.
        </p>

        <h2>Information You Provide</h2>
        <p>
            If you use our contact form, we collect the name, email address, and
            message you submit.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>We use information submitted through the contact form to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Respond to questions, comments, or requests;</li>
            <li>Communicate with you about your inquiry; and</li>
            <li>Maintain and protect the security of our website.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            We do not sell or rent customer information or use it for targeted
            advertising.
        </p>

        <h2>Service Providers</h2>
        <p>
            We use third-party service providers to operate certain website
            functions. These providers may process information as necessary to
            provide their services.
        </p>

        <p>
            We retrieve recent public Facebook post text, dates, links, and
            associated images server-side to display them on this website. That
            content is cached in Cloudflare KV and R2 to keep the feed current.
            The feed does not load a Facebook embed or Facebook script in your
            browser. Facebook’s privacy policy applies if you follow a Facebook
            link.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare:</strong> This website is hosted on and delivered
            through Cloudflare's infrastructure, which processes every request,
            including IP addresses, at the network layer. We also use Cloudflare
            Turnstile to help protect the contact form from spam, abuse, and
            automated submissions.
            </li>
            <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics:</strong> We use privacy-first,
            cookieless website analytics to understand aggregate visitor traffic,
            such as which pages are viewed. This service does not use cookies,
            does not fingerprint visitors, and does not collect personal
            information.
            </li>
            <li>
            <strong>Resend:</strong> Contact-form submissions are sent through
            Resend to the business mailbox so that we can receive and respond to
            messages. They are not stored in our D1 database.
            </li>
            <li>
            <strong>Google Maps:</strong> Our website includes an embedded map.
            Google may receive information about your interaction with the map
            under its own privacy practices.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>
            This website does not use advertising cookies or third-party
            advertising trackers. We do not use cookies to build advertising
            profiles or retarget visitors.
        </p>

        <p>
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure visits, page views,
          performance, and related technical information. It is privacy-focused
          and is not used for targeted advertising.
        </p>

        <p>
            We register a network-only service worker for the current site. We use
            local storage only to remember dismissal of the install prompt, and
            your browser may use normal browser caching for public website files.
            The site does not provide offline functionality through this service
            worker.
        </p>

        <p>
            An administrator who signs in may receive a <code>gb_session</code>
            authentication cookie. This cookie is HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax,
            and expires after 24 hours. It is used only for administrator
            authentication, not public visitor tracking.
        </p>

        <p>
            Some third-party services, including the embedded Google Map and
            Cloudflare Turnstile, may process technical information necessary to
            provide their services. Their practices are governed by their own
            privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
        <p>
            We do not sell or rent personal information. We may share information
            with service providers that help operate the website or deliver contact
            messages, or when required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
            We retain contact messages only for as long as reasonably necessary to
            respond to the inquiry, maintain business records, resolve disputes,
            or meet legal obligations.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Choices</h2>
        <p>
            You may contact us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of
            personal information you submitted through the contact form. We may
            need to verify your request before taking action.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
            This website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not
            knowingly collect personal information from children through the
            website.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy as our website or practices change.
            Any updates will be posted on this page with a revised “Last updated”
            date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
            For privacy questions or requests, contact Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill
            through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, call
            <a href="tel:+17159264431">(715) 926-4431</a>, or write to:
        </p>

        <address>
            Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill<br />
            102 S Eau Claire St<br />
            Mondovi, WI 54755
        </address>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page{
    padding:clamp(56px,9vw,100px) 20px;
  }

  .legal-content{
    max-width:800px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }

  h1{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);
    margin:8px 0;
  }

  h2{
    margin:38px 0 10px;
    font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,1.8rem);
  }

  p, li{
    color:var(--ink-2);
  }

  p{
    margin:0 0 16px;
  }

  ul{
    padding-left:24px;
    margin:0 0 18px;
  }

  li{
    margin:7px 0;
  }

  a{
    color:var(--crimson);
    text-decoration:underline;
    text-underline-offset:3px;
  }

  .updated{
    color:var(--ink-2);
    font-size:.92rem;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }

  address{
    color:var(--ink-2);
    font-style:normal;
  }
</style>
